{
    "title": "Tile Blast: Match ASMR Game",
    "description": "Do you like matching games? A brand new matching game - Tile Blast is online!\r\n\r\nHow to play the game?\r\nTap three of the same tiles to complete the clearing task. Collect all the tiles in the level to clear the board. There are some blocked tiles, please pay attention and carefully consider them before clicking the tiles. If the number of tiles exceeds the slot, it will fail! There will be generous coin rewards and New Stories after winning levels!\r\n\r\nGame features:\r\n- Fun gameplay\r\nThe game contains a variety of interesting ways to play, such as honey tiles, clicking on any one of them will move together; Chain tiles, removing a tile from either the left or right side of the chain can break the chain... More gameplay options are waiting for you to explore!\r\n- Novel game props\r\nThere are five main props in this game. Undo, tap to undo your last move; Shuffle, tap to shuffle all the tiles on the board; Tile Return, tap the broom to remove all tiles from the shelf; Magnet, tap the magnet to make an instant match; Extra Slots, can expand your shelf!\r\n- Various fun activities\r\nTravel Pass, win levels to get free rewards! Win Streak event, the more levels you win, the richer the treasure chest rewards will be! There is also an exciting ranking activity... No matter what kind of activity you join, you can obtain game props, coins, etc., which can help you pass the levels and make your game full of fun!\r\n- Unique game features\r\nIn addition to simple operation, full of challenges, and diverse activities, you can log in to the game every day to sign in, play the Lucky Spin, and watch videos to get rewards! Tile Blast also has a complete Team function, invite your friends to explore the game together!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Do you like matching games? A brand new matching game - Tile Blast is online!<br><br>How to play the game?<br>Tap three of the same tiles to complete the clearing task. Collect all the tiles in the level to clear the board. There are some blocked tiles, please pay attention and carefully consider them before clicking the tiles. If the number of tiles exceeds the slot, it will fail! There will be generous coin rewards and New Stories after winning levels!<br><br>Game features:<br>- Fun gameplay<br>The game contains a variety of interesting ways to play, such as honey tiles, clicking on any one of them will move together; Chain tiles, removing a tile from either the left or right side of the chain can break the chain... More gameplay options are waiting for you to explore!<br>- Novel game props<br>There are five main props in this game. Undo, tap to undo your last move; Shuffle, tap to shuffle all the tiles on the board; Tile Return, tap the broom to remove all tiles from the shelf; Magnet, tap the magnet to make an instant match; Extra Slots, can expand your shelf!<br>- Various fun activities<br>Travel Pass, win levels to get free rewards! Win Streak event, the more levels you win, the richer the treasure chest rewards will be! There is also an exciting ranking activity... No matter what kind of activity you join, you can obtain game props, coins, etc., which can help you pass the levels and make your game full of fun!<br>- Unique game features<br>In addition to simple operation, full of challenges, and diverse activities, you can log in to the game every day to sign in, play the Lucky Spin, and watch videos to get rewards! Tile Blast also has a complete Team function, invite your friends to explore the game together!",
    "summary": "Play the Tile Match Game,\u00a0Challenge yourself with Classic matching tiles game!",
